    <p>
      <b>Description</b>
    </p>
    <p>Multi-channel oscilloscope-style visualizer for time-series signals. Shows series over time with optional axis limits.</p>
    <p>
      <b>Ports</b>
    </p>
    <p>
      <b>Input(s)</b>
    </p>
    <table border="1">
      <thead>
